<section id="diagnostic-failures" class="space-y-6 text-foreground leading-relaxed">
  <div class="border-b border-border pb-4">
    <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-foreground flex items-center gap-2">
      <span>\u26A0\uFE0F</span>
      <span>6. Top 5 JOAPS Upload Rejection Traps &amp; Immediate Fixes</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-1">
      Every examination cycle, thousands of candidates receive scrutiny defect notices from the organizing IIT. Avoid these common errors to ensure guaranteed first-attempt approval.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
    <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border shadow-2xs space-y-2">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-rose-500 font-bold text-sm">
        <span>\u274C</span>
        <span>Trap 1: Capital Letters in Signature</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">
        Signing in block capital letters (e.g., "RAHUL SHARMA") is explicitly prohibited by IIT JAM examination bylaws. Applications with capital-letter signatures will be rejected without refund.
      </p>
      <div class="p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 text-xs text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-300 font-medium">
        \u2714 <strong>Fix:</strong> Sign in your natural cursive handwriting with running strokes in black or dark blue ink.
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border shadow-2xs space-y-2">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-rose-500 font-bold text-sm">
        <span>\u274C</span>
        <span>Trap 2: Flash Glare on Spectacles</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">
        If you wear prescription spectacles, smartphone flash often reflects off the glass surface, obscuring your pupils and iris. JOAPS facial recognition software flags this as unidentifiable.
      </p>
      <div class="p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 text-xs text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-300 font-medium">
        \u2714 <strong>Fix:</strong> Remove spectacles before clicking your photo or tilt them slightly downward to eliminate reflection.
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border shadow-2xs space-y-2">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-rose-500 font-bold text-sm">
        <span>\u274C</span>
        <span>Trap 3: Dark or Shadowed Background</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">
        Standing against a patterned wallpaper, colored curtain, or casting a dark shadow on the wall triggers automated background contrast rejection.
      </p>
      <div class="p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 text-xs text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-300 font-medium">
        \u2714 <strong>Fix:</strong> Stand 2 feet in front of a clean white wall with diffused front lighting, or use our automated background cleaning tool.
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border shadow-2xs space-y-2">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-rose-500 font-bold text-sm">
        <span>\u274C</span>
        <span>Trap 4: Distorted Aspect Ratio Stretching</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">
        Cropping a square 1:1 image and forcing it into a rectangular box without aspect-ratio locking compresses facial features horizontally, causing severe biometric skew.
      </p>
      <div class="p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 text-xs text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-300 font-medium">
        \u2714 <strong>Fix:</strong> SignResize locks the exact 3:4 portrait ratio and 3.5:1 signature ratio before rendering pixels.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

